Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,减速  停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Slow down! Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下...  求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow-- I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行行好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:57.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(艾琳)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,捂住耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样应该可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄好了叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me when.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.27,0:02:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把碎石和树枝用布包上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put something under the car like this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放在车下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a little gravel and sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.71,0:02:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,增加摩擦力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives you traction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪她把车开到泥里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't have to do it if she didn't get us stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:52.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an honest mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要让她跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you let her come?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她把你引到伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took you to Woodbury
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说她半路失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you said split on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.65,0:03:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-奥斯卡因此而死...  -事情并不那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Oscar died and you guys-- - It wasn't that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天之所以带上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked her to come today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.19,0:03:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我不在监狱  我不想把她留在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to leave her at the prison if I wasn't there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.45,0:03:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和莫尔一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}not with Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,况且我俩利益相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}That and we got common interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就目前来看  我们是一条船上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For right now, we have the same problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定还可以联合作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe we can work on them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是目前吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.85,0:03:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  暂时而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just for right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你们了  千万别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you! Don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行行好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.31,0:03:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没被咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇上还有其它警察局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any other police stations in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我原来就是这的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the police here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和其他几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and a few other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个镇不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't a big town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其它地方可以找一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's other places to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许枪没有这多  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}May not have as many guns as were in here, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有多少枪我们都得带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need as many guns as were in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-弹药也是  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ammo, too. - Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在  我只知道几个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now, I only got a line on a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主街道上有几个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a few places out on the main street--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒吧  还有一个烟酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}bars, a liquor store.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店主都有一两把枪  放在柜台后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owners had a gun or two behind the counter
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家当时都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}that people didn't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我签了枪支许可证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. I signed the permits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些枪可能还在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might still be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我的想法有意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a problem with that approach?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  瑞克  我没有意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Rick. I don't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:09.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(远离此地)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是什么  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(不用内疚  你知道的)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(往回走  别找死)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(听忠告)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(混蛋)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来有人已经占了这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's looks like someone already made these theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不意味着他们拿走了我们要找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean they found what we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.74,0:08:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有几个地方就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of the places are just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们进去拿了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提利尔家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyrell's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.89,0:09:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一把猎枪  两把手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shotgun and two handguns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,核发提利尔·迪比的枪支许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}License issued to Tyrell Debbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会被绊住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下手中的东西  离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you drop what you got and you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:41.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下你们的枪  鞋子  还有那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guns, your shoes, and that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有东西  限你们十秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it. 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-往车那跑  -十\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run for the car now. - Ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爸爸  -我们需要那把步枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad. - We need that rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}...nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我能上去  -七\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I can get up there. - ...seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-六  -卡尔  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- six... - Carl, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你往车那跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to run for the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须得做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他穿着防弹衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wearing body armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他还活着  -和我们有关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's alive. - Do we care?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.51,0:11:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:11:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye out for booby traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来他防人之心很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he's gotten pretty creative so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是进去拿了枪就回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were just gonna get in and get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能抛下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道你说他帮过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you said he helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他原来不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't like this then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.27,0:12:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  他还有个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, he has a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为他在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心有陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said booby traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他搬进去就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get him inside and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(危险  没骗你)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.93,0:13:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(没骗你吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  小心金属线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, watch the wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去年带他去过武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed him that weapons locker last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里面有这么多武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it had all of this in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  这还不到一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not even half.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一直没闲着  有床\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been busy. The cot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(清醒)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(门把手  手中刀)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(德韦恩变行尸了)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等他醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna wait for him to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让我们离开  他不知道我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told us to go. He didn't know who we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他试图杀我们  我们没把他留给行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill us and we didn't leave him for the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他够走运了  他也不需要这么多武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had a good day. He doesn't need half of these guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们急需\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等他醒过来  不要说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're waiting for him to wake up. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好好看过这个地方了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you taken a look around this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.02,0:16:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斧子  矛  墙上的字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The axe, the spikes, the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你觉得他疯了吗  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think he's crazy? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.03,0:16:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识的是以前的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't like this then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.83,0:16:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等他醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna wait for him to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:22.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(瑞克家  已烧光)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房子没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你跟来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you wanted to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:40.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想看看咱们家的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这就开始吃他的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're eating his food now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:01.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门垫上写着  欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mat said "Welcome."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(国王郡咖啡馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想去找补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going on a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.69,0:18:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想人们不会去抢婴儿床的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe the one thing people didn't loot was cribs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.69,0:18:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个婴儿用品店是妈妈的朋友萨拉开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's that baby place that mom's friend Sara ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就在街角  -卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just around the corner. - Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  它就在街角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it's just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:31.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到处都有给行尸设下的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's all those walker traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要帮忙抬箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need some help carrying the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想找个婴儿床  你得先弄个箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna get the crib, you have to get the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那玩意儿又大又重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big and heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得找人帮你搬箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need help carrying the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:46.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是打算弄个婴儿床  没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are getting a crib, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我和他一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll go with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.62,0:18:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能去那  我们说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there, that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你遇上麻烦  就大声呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get into trouble, you holler, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我在这就能听见  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll hear it from here. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你没必要和我一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应你爸帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told your dad I'd help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.89,0:19:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得先把那个解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we should take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚玩的是哪出\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想靠自己的力量办好这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚走过了婴儿用品店\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've just pass the baby place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要先给朱迪思找点别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting Judith something else first, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真遗憾这些事发生在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry this happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.72,0:21:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(所有人都不是人)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是谁吗  你还认得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who I am? Do you see who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是戴着死人脸的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}People wearing dead people's faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.51,0:22:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-摩根你听我说  -不  我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morgan, listen to me. - No, I don't know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.99,0:22:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你认识我  -我不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do know me. - I don't know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.91,0:22:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救过我的命  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.00,0:22:21.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不清醒了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't clear, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.19,0:22:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.86,0:22:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在谁都不认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anyone anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.82,0:22:48.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这条疯狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crazy son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.52,0:22:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.92,0:22:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.01,0:23:24.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你成全了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.99,0:23:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kill me. Just--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.36,0:23:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我一了百了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去年  你在我家前院找到了我  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found me last year in my front yard, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.78,0:23:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和...  你找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and-- you found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.23,0:23:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我吃的  你告诉我发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fed me. You told me what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.99,0:23:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫瑞克·格兰姆斯  你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Rick Grimes. You know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.60,0:23:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有戴着一张死人脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not wearing a dead man's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.34,0:23:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给了你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.61,0:24:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过  每天清晨把它打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, turn it on every day at dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.66,0:24:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就能找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you could find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.01,0:24:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.09,0:24:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  见鬼  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. Damn it, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.05,0:24:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你  我知道你是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you. I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.88,0:24:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你每天清晨都会打开对讲机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd turn yours on at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.49,0:24:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是那么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.12,0:24:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始我没准备找你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I hadn't worked up to it yet, and--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.02,0:24:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但后来我找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.33,0:24:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在房顶上  我和我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the roof, every morning for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.91,0:24:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼叫了好几天  好几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}For weeks, me and my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.46,0:24:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.63,0:24:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩下我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.57,0:24:49.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但里面只有静电噪音  只有噪音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just static, though. Nothing but static.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.41,0:24:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来什么声音都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then nothing but nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.18,0:24:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不在  你从没有呼叫过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't there. You were never there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我呼叫过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.76,0:24:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我找你的时候你从没在过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not when I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.21,0:24:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你会每天清晨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you said you would turn on your radio
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-都把对讲机打开  -摩根  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- every day at dawn. - Morgan, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.95,0:25:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你会每天清晨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that you would turn on your radio...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.76,0:25:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-都把对讲机打开  -我打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyday at dawn.  - I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你从没出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.06,0:25:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我迫不得已越走越远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept getting... I kept getting pushed farther out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.81,0:25:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须那么做  别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to. I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.45,0:25:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了我的妻儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found my wife and my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.90,0:25:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.50,0:25:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有责任保障他们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被逼无奈  越走越远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kept getting pushed back deeper into the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.63,0:25:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对天发誓  我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.55,0:25:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿回你的对讲机吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have your radio back
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.76,0:25:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在总算是找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it looks like I finay found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到了你老婆和儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found your wife and your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.00,0:25:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你脑子里只有他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happened right? You found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.49,0:25:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did they...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.55,0:26:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老婆她...  她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}did she... did your wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.58,0:26:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她变行尸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did she turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.74,0:26:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.26,0:26:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你没看到她的尸变过程吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you didn't have to see that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.52,0:26:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.65,0:26:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.77,0:26:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像我  不像我老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like me. Not like my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.64,0:26:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得她经历了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember what happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.75,0:26:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道她变成什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember what she was?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.53,0:26:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.14,0:26:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.56,0:26:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给过我枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.18,0:26:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你尝试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.13,0:26:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尝试了什么  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I try, Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.66,0:26:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尝试了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I try?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.37,0:26:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你尝试让我做该做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to get me to do it 'cause I was supposed to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该杀死她  我的珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to kill her, my Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.13,0:27:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道应该杀  但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew I was supposed to, but I let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.75,0:27:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像不知道会有报应一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go like there wasn't gonna be a reckoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.80,0:27:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们总是在找食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We was always looking for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.19,0:27:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的  食物最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it alway came down to food.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.75,0:27:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.08,0:27:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在检查一个地窖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was checking out a cellar
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.38,0:27:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让德韦恩一起下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't want Duane to come down there with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.75,0:27:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我上去时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when I came up...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.31,0:27:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她站在他面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was standing there right in front of him
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.49,0:27:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他举起了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he had his gun up
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.98,0:27:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.18,0:27:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我叫了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I called to him
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.30,0:27:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他转过身\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.78,0:27:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she was just--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.16,0:27:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扑向他\N{\fnArial\fs30}just on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.76,0:27:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我眼前一片一片的血红\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I see red. I see red.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.67,0:27:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都被染成了红色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is red. Everything I see is red.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.23,0:27:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于下了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.11,0:28:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.47,0:28:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早该杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.81,0:28:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.79,0:28:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太懦弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.01,0:28:18.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把枪给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.54,0:28:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, your boy--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.54,0:28:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.72,0:28:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没有  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.87,0:28:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.85,0:28:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为像你一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, 'cause people like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.69,0:28:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这种好人总会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}the good people, they always die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.61,0:28:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏人也会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the bad people do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.66,0:28:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但懦弱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the weak people,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.78,0:28:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the people like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.39,0:28:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们却生存了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have inherited the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.00,0:29:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(国王郡咖啡馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.03,0:29:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.85,0:29:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我会让你进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I was gonna let you go in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.93,0:29:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我做什么不关你事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.78,0:29:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不了解我  不了解我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me. You don't know my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.36,0:29:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came out here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.18,0:29:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来是因为利益相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came out here for common interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.86,0:29:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有共同的敌人和共同的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the same enemy and the same problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.80,0:29:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才来这里  就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why you're here. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.26,0:30:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.61,0:30:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道如何做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know how I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.10,0:30:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无法阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.69,0:30:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实无法阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.97,0:30:21.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你也无法阻止我帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't stop me from helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.17,0:32:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.07,0:32:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我必须回去  -掉哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got to go back in. - Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.82,0:32:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回去  必须回去  我要回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go back. We have to. I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.53,0:32:47.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就剩这一张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only one left!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.58,0:32:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  -这样不行  \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fine. - Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.98,0:32:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我不了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you. I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.53,0:33:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你能帮我个忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can you do something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.30,0:33:02.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.94,0:33:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我能帮上忙  -不用  别说废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can help. - No. And no more bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.97,0:33:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.70,0:33:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.81,0:33:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just--
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.22,0:33:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得朱迪思应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought Judith should--
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.96,0:33:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该知道妈妈长什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}should know what her mom looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.48,0:34:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.35,0:34:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来也是要回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna go back in anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.75,0:34:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不能把这个留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just couldn't leave this behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.75,0:34:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它太可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just too damn gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.77,0:34:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.36,0:34:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不应该是那样的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's what's supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.55,0:34:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你该和我们一起回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're supposed to come back with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.56,0:34:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在刚发生的一切后吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.09,0:34:32.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我试图轰掉你的脑袋  捅伤你后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After me trying to blow your head off,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.83,0:34:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从此幸福地生活在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}stab your heart out, happily ever after together?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.34,0:34:36.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀不了我  我也杀不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't kill me, I couldn't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.82,0:34:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这是某种天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that as a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.39,0:34:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了一座监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.60,0:34:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱的围墙能把行尸挡住\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fences can keep 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.63,0:34:53.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妻子是在那里死的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that where your wife died?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.54,0:34:58.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.57,0:35:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别回来  也别停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go back. Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.85,0:35:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能活几天多活几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get yourself some more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.76,0:35:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.53,0:35:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以和我们一起回去  你能痊愈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come back with us. You can heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.50,0:35:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿了很多枪  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking a lot of guns, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.67,0:35:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我就想说那些枪可不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm just saying that that all is a lot of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.17,0:35:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要那么多枪干嘛  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you need the guns, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.78,0:35:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你如果有什么好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if you got something good,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.18,0:35:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一定会有人眼红来抢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that just means that there's someone who wants to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.32,0:35:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实就是这样  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is what is happening, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.20,0:35:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.08,0:35:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以去我们那里  你能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be there. You can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.07,0:35:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着你们的不是尖牙就是子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be torn apart by teeth or bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.80,0:35:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.66,0:35:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你手下的人  可我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people, but not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.08,0:35:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不会再目睹那样的惨剧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I am not gonna watch that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.19,0:35:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你把这些枪拿走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you take the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.63,0:35:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有机会活下去  所以你无法正视\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's a chance. That's what you can't square.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.07,0:35:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这让你心如刀割\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.52,0:35:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.60,0:35:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的话你一个字也没听进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you heard a damn word that I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.75,0:36:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的经历一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both started out in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.52,0:36:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你遭遇了不幸  我也遭遇了不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things went bad for you, things went bad for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.99,0:36:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你无法正确看待事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not seeing things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.88,0:36:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怪你  你失去了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you. What you've lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.66,0:36:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,导致你无法正确看待事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not seeing things right,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.75,0:36:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你能从中恢复  我知道你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can come back from this, I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.59,0:36:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也必须做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.33,0:36:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定能振作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.03,0:36:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要恢复过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be able come back from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.74,0:36:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -摩根  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Morgan, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.16,0:36:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.40,0:36:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.24,0:36:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天没死是天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I didn't die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.34,0:36:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天让我清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.81,0:36:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须这样  必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to, man. I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.40,0:36:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.06,0:37:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正准备找你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just about to look for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.97,0:37:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  -没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.55,0:37:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.68,0:37:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.58,0:37:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.44,0:38:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.99,0:38:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.02,0:38:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.58,0:38:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡尔  -摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.85,0:38:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须向你开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.30,0:38:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能理解我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I had to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.21,0:38:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.18,0:38:34.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.00,0:38:39.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远别内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.07,0:39:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和她在一起还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.58,0:39:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想她跟我们是一路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she might be one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.62,0:39:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.42,0:39:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything went okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.06,0:39:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车吧  我把它放后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop in. I'll throw this in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.01,0:39:51.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出现幻觉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.79,0:39:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你出现幻觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you see things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.44,0:39:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.24,0:40:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我过去也曾和我死去的男友"对话"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to talk to my dead boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.67,0:40:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是正常现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.59,0:40:15.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.71,0:40:17.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.31,0:40:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.50,0:40:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.31,0:40:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(远离此地)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.78,0:41:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,